00:51:47.498 --> 00:52:07.134
I can recommend this book. It's very approachable. It's similar as podcasts in this regard, as somebody's just talking and having a conversation and the other person is asking questions and he replies. This is also a very big value point of his seminars because people ask questions and then he has to clarify. That's very cool.

00:52:08.416 --> 00:52:19.556
